/**
 * @defgroup raze_meta Metaprogramming
 * @brief Zero-overhead compile-time metaprogramming primitives and tuple facilities in `raze::meta`.
 *
 * Provides compile-time index and type tags, an ABI-friendly aggregate `raze::meta::tuple`
 * with flat register-friendly storage and zero-copy reference views, and a full suite of
 * `constexpr` tuple traits, visitation, queries, transformations, reductions, structural
 * combinators, compile-time pattern permutations, type-level filters, and generators.
 *
 * ### Categories
 *
 * | Group | Entities |
 * | :--- | :--- |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tags | `index_t`, `index`, `type_t`, `type_v`, `literals::operator""_c` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple | `tuple`, `tuple<>`, `get`, `operator==`, `operator<=>`, `repeat_tuple_t`, `make_tuple_exact`, `make_tuple`, `tie`, `forward_as_tuple` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_traits | `is_tuple_v`, `tuple_like`, `size_v`, `element_t`, `member_t`, `sized_tuple_like`, `non_empty_tuple_like`, `same_size_tuples`, `count_type_v`, `contains_type_v`, `type_index_v`, `all_unique_types_v`, `is_homogeneous_v`, `apply_traits_t`, `map_traits_t`, `as_tuple_t` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_access | `to_ref`, `reversed_ref`, `to_tuple`, `as_tuple`, `make_from_tuple`, `from_tuple`, `front`, `back`, `apply` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_visit | `for_each`, `for_each_reversed`, `for_each_index`, `for_each_index_reversed`, `adjacent_for_each`, `adjacent_for_each_reversed`, `visit_at`, `visit_at_index`, `try_visit_at` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_query | `all_of`, `all_of_reversed`, `any_of`, `any_of_reversed`, `none_of`, `none_of_reversed`, `count`, `count_if`, `find_index_if`, `locate`, `find_last_index_if`, `rlocate` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_transform | `map`, `transform`, `map_reversed`, `transform_reversed`, `map_index`, `map_index_reversed`, `adjacent_map`, `member_cast`, `select` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_reduce | `fold_left`, `fold_left_index`, `fold_right`, `fold_right_index`, `reduce`, `map_reduce`, `sum`, `prod`, `bit_and`, `bit_or`, `bit_xor`, `min`, `max`, `inner_product`, `inclusive_scan_left`, `exclusive_scan_left`, `inclusive_scan_right`, `exclusive_scan_right` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_structural | `cat`, `cat_ref`, `slice`, `slice_ref`, `extract`, `extract_ref`, `take`, `take_ref`, `drop`, `drop_ref`, `split`, `split_ref`, `split_half`, `split_half_ref`, `chunks`, `chunks_ref`, `windows`, `windows_ref`, `stride`, `stride_ref`, `interleave`, `interleave_ref`, `deinterleave`, `deinterleave_ref`, `push_front`, `push_back`, `pop_front`, `pop_back`, `insert_at`, `erase_at`, `replace_at`, `swap_at`, `swap_at_ref` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_permute | `reorder`, `reorder_ref`, `permute`, `permute_ref`, `reverse`, `reverse_ref`, `rotate_left`, `rotate_left_ref`, `rotate_right`, `rotate_right_ref`, `swap_adjacent`, `swap_adjacent_ref`, `zip`, `zip_ref`, `zip_min`, `transpose`, `transpose_ref`, `unzip`, `unzip_ref`, `flatten`, `flatten_all`, `cartesian_product` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_filter | `filter`, `filter_ref`, `filter_not`, `filter_not_ref`, `partition`, `unique_types`, `dedup_types` |
 * | @ref raze_meta_tuple_generate | `fill`, `splat`, `generate`, `generate_reversed`, `iota` |
 */

